sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Gateway as Gateway
    participant Badges as Badges service
    participant DB as Postgres

    User->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/badges/{userId}
    Gateway->>Badges: same path, x-user-id set after authorize
    alt x-user-id missing or not userId
        Badges-->>User: 404 NOT_FOUND
    else owner
        Badges->>DB: catalog, user_metrics row, user_badge rows
        Note over Badges: earned from user_badge, progress from the metrics
        Badges-->>User: 200 every catalog badge
    end
